# Diagnosis route, no balloon caught yet (2026-10-14, runs gk_b43 and gk_b43b, both rc 0, 0 fatal).
# Goal: a boss talk balloon of the Delfino GateKeeper (common/2d/balloon.bmg). Source conditions:
#   gatekeeper.cpp:950-978 TNerveBGKWait2 counts unk288 once per bck 0x11 -> 0xF -> 0x10 loop; at 2 it shows 0xE0000.
#   gatekeeper.cpp:843-856 TNerveBGKAppear shows 0xE0047 when unk28A (appearance counter) reaches 2.
#   gatekeeper.cpp:776-784 shows the hint 0xE002E after 160 ticks of bck 7 with unk154 > 0.
# Measured with this route (dolpic/0 dev start, runs gk_b43, gk_b43b):
#   Mario spawns at (6500,300,-3850), the boss sits at (12,300,4631) and sleeps in bck 0xA.
#   A tp next to it does not wake it; a 40-frame spray wakes it for about 30 ticks (bck 0x4, unk154 3, hp stays 3)
#   and it goes back to sleep. Continuous spray (gk_b43) keeps it in the fight loop (bck 0x7/0x12) with unk154 = 0,
#   so neither the hint nor the Wait2 loop is reached.
# Next attempt: walk in like the accepted route 85 (5380,2700 / 4980,3100 / 20,5140, then faceto 12,4631) instead of tp;
# a raw dev start does not enter the arena the way the route does.
# Start like tools/routes/76_boss_hp_probe.dev: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1
#   SUNSHINE_DEV_SEED=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_AIM_ASSIST=1 SUNSHINE_RENDER_SCALE=1
#   settings.ini [video] fsr1=0 widescreen=1 aspect=4:3
# Run: python tools/route.py Strict tools/routes/99_talk_text_boss.dev --name gk_b43b --seconds 420 SUNSHINE_DEV_AIM_ASSIST=1
# Evidence when it works: gk_*.png (the balloon text), [status-boss] bck/unk154 lines, 0 fatal, rc of the run.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
cheat infinite_water
wait frames=60
log
tp x=12 y=320 z=5150 yaw=180
wait frames=2
shot gk_tp000.png
hold L trig=255,255 frames=40 # wake the boss (unk154 > 0 -> decHitPoints -> hp 2)
wait frames=8
shot gk_tp050.png
wait frames=40
shot gk_tp100.png
wait frames=40
shot gk_tp150.png
wait frames=40
shot gk_tp200.png
wait frames=40
shot gk_tp250.png
wait frames=40
